  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Transforming Waypoint Rendering**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on `WaypointRenderable`. It\'s currently underwhelming, just a basic round rect. The goal is to make it a lot more exciting! I\'m planning to make it render a 3D Parcel or Newspaper model right in the beacon beam. If the category is `DeliveryCategory.NEWSPAPER`, I\'ll display a 3D rolled newspaper.\n\n\n**Revising Building Rendering**\n\nI\'m now rewriting `BuildingRenderable`. My focus is now on implementing an accurate face visibility check. This involves considering the camera\'s position relative to the building\'s bounds. I\'m also planning correct 3D projection and realistic directional lighting. I\'m imagining how the roof will catch top sunlight, the south face basking in warm light, and so on. Charming storefront details are also on my mind, particularly large showcase windows on the ground floor.\n\n\n"
