  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the requested enhancements for **Lalameow Rider**, addressing the playable character, 3D world models, delivery items, asset library, and landscape orientation:\n\n- **Playable Character (Nami The Cat Courier)**:\n  - **Immediate 3D Gameplay on Boot**: Disabled blocking overlay modals on game launch so players spawn directly onto their scooter in the vibrant 3D world.\n  - **Multi-Angle Character Rendering**: Added expressive anime cat eyes with blinking animations, emerald irises, catchlights, rosy cheeks, pink triangular nose, whiskers, and smiling expression for front and free-look camera angles.\n  - **Dynamic Riding & Cargo Physics**: Enhanced the 3D cat rider with steering handlebar articulation, scooter lean physics, waving tail, exhaust smoke particles, and visible 3D parcels or newspaper rolls strapped to the rear cargo rack when actively on a delivery route.\n\n- **3D World Environment & Buildings**:\n  - **5-Face Architectural Rendering**: Implemented multi-surface perspective buildings complete with illuminated upper windows, ground storefront display windows, entrance doors, 3D striped awnings with drop shadows, elevated signboards, and concrete sidewalk curbs.\n  - **Miniature Diorama Aesthetic**: Formatted the street grid with asphalt road markings, zebra pedestrian crossings, and sidewalk trees.\n\n- **3D Delivery Items & Active Quest**:\n  - **3D World Delivery Beacons**: Floating, bobbing, and rotating 3D delivery models at target waypoints featuring rolled *The Daily Purr* newspapers with tied blue ribbons or kraft cardboard parcels with yellow courier tape and paw stamps, framed by orbiting sparkle stars and holographic ground rings.\n  - **First-Run Delivery Job**: Pre-configured an active morning delivery from *The Daily Purr Press* directly down the road to *Grandma Whiskers\' Cottage*.\n\n- **Game Asset Library & Showcase**:\n  - Added a dedicated **\360\237\216\250 Asset Library** button to the HUD action bar, providing an interactive showcase displaying high-resolution visual assets for Nami, delivery props, the miniature city diorama, town citizens, and custom UI icons.\n\n- **Forced Horizontal / Landscape Mode**:\n  - Configured `sensorLandscape` orientation in the Android manifest and main activity to ensure the game opens horizontally from launch."
