tion bar, providing an interactive showcase displaying high-resolution visual assets for Nami, delivery props, the miniature city diorama, town citizens, and custom UI icons.\n\n- **Forced Horizontal / Landscape Mode**:\n  - Configured `sensorLandscape` orientation in the Android manifest and main activity to ensure the game opens horizontally from launch."
